 "applies_to": "Invertek Optidrive E3 (ODE-3) IP20 drives on the RJ45 Modbus RTU port, per user guide 82-E3I20-IN V1.05.",
 "summary": "Invertek's compact general purpose variable frequency drive with Modbus RTU on the front RJ45 port. Registers 1-4 take the control word, frequency setpoint, PI setpoint and ramp time; registers 7-24 and 2001-2016 report status, output values, I/O and the trip code. Parameters P-04 to P-60 sit at register 128 + parameter number. This map covers the control and monitoring block plus the command-source parameter.",
 "transport": [
  "RTU"
 ],
